# Build context for frontend/Dockerfile.
#
# That Dockerfile runs `npm ci` and then `COPY . .`. Without this file the host's
# node_modules was copied over the one npm ci had just installed — and on a
# Windows machine those are win32 native binaries (SWC, lightningcss) inside a
# Linux image. .env.local would also have been baked into the build.

node_modules
.next
out
build
coverage

.env
.env.*

*.md
*.tsbuildinfo
npm-debug.log*
.DS_Store
